   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PMU IAP Kos 1</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PMU IOP Kos 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PMU4s project is part of an integrated area program in the Kacanik area. The PMU project is reconstruction of 100 houses, local infrastructure and some equipment for local schools. Target group are Kosovo-Albanians who were refugees in Macedonia and that PMU/AGAPE Macedonia gave humanitarian assistance.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PMULWF4s projekt &#xe4;r ett integrerat &#xe5;teruppbyggnadsprogram f&#xf6;r 100 familjer i Kacanik omr&#xe5;det. Projektet v&#xe4;nder sig till &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande Kosovoalbaner som &#xe5;terv&#xe4;nt sedan konflikten upph&#xf6;rt. &#xc4;garna till de 100 husen erh&#xe5;ller material f&#xf6;r att vinterbona sina hem inf&#xf6;r vintern med medel fr&#xe5;n Sida. Projektet inkl &#xe4;ven lokal infrastruktur.</narrative>
  </description>
